(text "Board A \"knob-base\" (GaggiMate knob rev 1). Circuit from SmartKnob View view_base (Scott Bezek, Apache-2.0):\nkept MT6701 encoder, HX711 + PNP AVDD regulator, 4x 2512 strain-gauge bridge, GNDA net tie.\nRemoved: ESP32, USB/CH340, regulators, TMC6300, LEDs, VEML7700, LCD pads, J4/J5 gauge pads.\nChanges: L1 3.3uH -> FB1 basic ferrite bead; S8550-family PNP (C8542, basic) instead of MMBT4403;\npower + data from Board B on J1 (JST-SH 8p): 1 3V3, 2 GND, 3 ENC_CS, 4 ENC_CLK, 5 ENC_DO, 6 HX_SCK, 7 HX_DOUT, 8 GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "70288df7-46cb-5fab-840e-7ae5f0ffd7b5"))
